    "objective": "Migrate context and evaluator command boundaries\n\nRF-24/RF-25 vertical slice: give context/evaluator operations granular knowledge/backend/Git/policy capabilities and typed in-process results/renderers.",
    "acceptance_criteria": [
      "bun run guards:check",
      "bun run schemas:check",
      "bun run test:critical",
      "bun run typecheck",
      "- In scope: context search/show/ingest/reindex/wiki/graph/doctor and evaluator prepare/apply/run compatibility commands, typed use cases, granular capabilities, output renderers, and elimination of subprocess/stdout orchestration in this family.\n- Out of scope: runner/Hermes, general task lifecycle, or provider/release commands.",
      "1. Declare exact context/evaluator capability sets and ports.\n2. Reuse typed supervisor, journal, retrieval, and evaluator use cases.\n3. Separate CLI parsing/rendering from result application.\n4. Remove direct OS/Git/network access and internal command subprocesses.\n5. Run context/evaluator schema, fixture, rendering, and capability tests.",
      "1. Invoke migrated context/evaluator use cases in-process. Expected: typed results and no stdout capture/subprocess.\n2. Run human/JSON snapshots and schema fixtures. Expected: approved compatibility plus explicit v0.7 versions.\n3. Attempt mutation from read-only evaluator or undeclared context capability. Expected: typed denial.\n4. Run context/evaluator tests, schemas, guards, and typecheck."
    ]
